# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day26

## Question

Tell me about a time when something was different from what you expected.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- What you expected
- What actually happened
- Why it was different
- How you felt
- What happened afterward

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> I didn't expect...

Also try to use:

> I thought...

> But it turned out that...

> In the end,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

I expected...

↓

But...

↓

I didn't expect...

↓

I felt...

↓

In the end,...
